n` targets or an explicit \"no lint targets in this diff\" that the repo policy\n   accepts).\n3. No bypass (`--no-verify`, `core.hooksPath=/dev/null`) is used in the reproduction, and the\n   resulting commit exists on the branch.\n4. `bash tests/selftest.sh` still passes and the guard's secrets and full-test legs still run.","acceptance_criteria":"1. A documentation-only commit completes through the guard with Tier 1 PASS, not DEGRADED PASS, from a clean worktree.\n2. The guard log shows the lint gate executed and names its targets instead of skipping.\n3. No bypass (--no-verify, core.hooksPath=/dev/null) is used and the commit exists on the branch.\n4. bash tests/selftest.sh still passes and the secrets and full-test legs still run.","created_at":"2026-10-30T21:34:16Z","updated_at":"2026-11-03T15:16:10Z","detail":{"fingerprint":"361e72f920d9905fd8f497705acea7a01acb7e86436655aa7ce2af5e57470c50"},"foreman_note":"Root cause measured 2026-10-30 in gitreins 0.17.1: engine/guard_manager.py::_check_lint builds py_files from changed_files filtered to '*.py' and never reads guards.lint_command; with no staged .py it returns GuardResult(skipped=True, skip_reason='no staged files'). Experiment in this repo's worktree: staging any *.py makes the identical tree return Tier 1 PASS with 'lint — ok'; staging none (every docs/README/board/shell-only commit) returns DEGRADED PASS and, with allow_skips:false, the commit is refused. So the blast radius is every non-Python commit in this repo, not documentation only. grade_full_tree exists but is CLI-only (gitreins guard --full), there is no config key; repo-side options are (a) allow_skips:true — weakens the gate, (b) invoke the hook as 'gitreins guard --full' so lint grades the tree's four .py files and names them — no weakening, local hook change, not shippable in-repo, (c) upstream: make the lint lane honour lint_command or accept a non-.py scope. Evidence: docs/audits/code-factory-readme-2026-10-30-20-29-25.md and guard logs guard-20261030T231404 and guard-20261030T232504.\n\nSync lane 2026-11-03: reproduced. A docs+board-only commit (docs/BOARD.md, new docs/audits/ artifact, two board rows) was refused twice by the pre-commit guard at 15:15:17Z and 15:15:57Z. Both runs: secrets clean, tests (full) PASS; the block is DEGRADED PASS from lint skipping with reason 'no staged files' / 'No Python files staged'. guards.allow_skips is false in .gitreins/config.yaml. The work was committed with the documented core.hooksPath bypass and the bypass is disclosed in that commit message. Row stays pending: the guard still refuses docs-only changes."}
